  "Plot three numeric columns in 3D": ["Drei numerische Spalten in 3D darstellen","Representar tres columnas numéricas en 3D","رسم سه ستون عددی به‌صورت سه‌بعدی","Représenter trois colonnes numériques en 3D","Rappresenta tre colonne numeriche in 3D","3 つの数値列を 3D でプロットする","Plotar três colunas numéricas em 3D","以 3D 绘制三个数值列","以 3D 繪製三個數值欄"],
